  "system": {
    "biography": "<p>Knight Errant contract security. <em>\"Currently at a Group Three training level, these guards are a cut above the usual corporate security guard, but not elite.\"</em></p><p><strong>Four are on Euphoria at all times:</strong> two precede her vehicle in a modified Ford Americar, one drives her Nightsky, one stays in the condo. These are the professionals slaughtered by Craft's Soldiers at the penthouse — their bodies are the horror the runners find.</p><p><strong>For the PRC-42D Wasp pilot:</strong> use this block with <strong>Rotor 3</strong> in place of Car 3 (QE p.16).</p><p><em>Queen Euphoria p.15 + p.19, both verified from renders. The old actor was wrong on six counts — Intelligence, Willpower, Essence, Unarmed Combat, three missing skills, an invented Stealth, and the wrong gun.</em></p>",
